  m_Name: FlamethrowerTeam
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Flamethrower Team
  role: 3
  description: 'Two troopers with Flamethrowers for clearing buildings and cover
    at close quarters. Each Flamethrower fires 3 shots a volley, each doing 10 damage
    that ignores armor, but only against Biological targets and only out to 10 m,
    so the team has to get close. When a trooper dies there''s a 10% chance their
    tank explodes, hurting everyone within 5 m: keep them away from your own squads.
    In close range they fall back on pistols. A Specialist: one per army.'
